<title>UK: BOE allots 205 mln stg in 6.0% repos at noon.</title>
<headline>BOE allots 205 mln stg in 6.0% repos at noon.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-03-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of England said it allotted 205 million stg in 6.0 percent fixed rate repos to March 24 and 25 in its noon operations.</p>
</text>
